{"sections":[{"kind":"hero","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"SpriteKit으로 작은 2D 퍼즐을 먼저 만들고, GameStore로 상태와 규칙을 분리한 뒤, 나중에 SceneKit 큐브로 확장하는 한국어 튜토리얼입니다.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"정규 트랙은 1-9장입니다. 약 100분 안에 2D SpriteKit 퍼즐을 만들고, 그 화면을 SceneKit 큐브 한 면에 붙인 뒤, 큐브 표면 터치를 tile 이름으로 바꾸는 데서 끝냅니다. 11장 이후는 더 긴 추가 단계입니다.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"큐브 한붓그리기 퍼즐","action":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/01-SpriteKit-Scene-And-Container-Layers","overridingTitle":"Get started","type":"reference","isActive":true,"overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"text":"Get started","type":"text"}]}},{"kind":"volume","image":null,"content":[],"chapters":[{"image":"chapter-spritekit.svg","tutorials":["doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/01-SpriteKit-Scene-And-Container-Layers","doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/02-SpriteKit-Tiles-And-Touch-Names","doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/03-Foundation-Board-Model-And-TileID","doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/04-Foundation-GameStore-And-Neighbor-Rule"],"name":"정규 트랙 A: SpriteKit 첫 화면","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI 안에 SpriteKit scene을 올리고, layer와 tile, touch 흐름을 작은 화면에서 익힙니다."}]}]},{"image":"chapter-foundation.svg","tutorials":["doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/05-SwiftUI-StateObject-And-Scene-Connection","doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/06-SwiftUI-Undo-And-Three-By-Three","doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/07-SceneKit-Cube-Material-And-Texture-Touch","doc:\/\/com.example.CubeOneStrokePuzzleKO\/tutorials\/Cube-One-Stroke-Puzzle-KO\/08-SceneKit-Rotation-Mode","doc:\